MATRIX: One-nearest neighbour. Distance is squared Euclidean, so the root is unnecessary.

ESCAPE THE MATRIX

HUSTLE dist WITH a AND b
  BUGATTI dx EQUALS CALL at (a, 0) MINUS CALL at (b, 0)
  BUGATTI dy EQUALS CALL at (a, 1) MINUS CALL at (b, 1)
  CASH OUT dx TIMES dx PLUS dy TIMES dy
DONE HUSTLING

HUSTLE nearest WITH points AND labels AND query
  BUGATTI best EQUALS 0
  BUGATTI bestgap EQUALS CALL dist (CALL at (points, 0), query)
  BUGATTI i EQUALS 1
  GRIND WHILE i IS LESS THAN CALL length WITH points
    BUGATTI gap EQUALS CALL dist (CALL at (points, i), query)
    IF gap IS LESS THAN bestgap THEN
      BUGATTI best EQUALS i
      BUGATTI bestgap EQUALS gap
    PERIOD
    BUGATTI i EQUALS i PLUS 1
  STOP GRINDING
  CASH OUT CALL at (labels, best)
DONE HUSTLING

BUGATTI points EQUALS [[1, 1], [1, 2], [5, 5], [6, 5]]
BUGATTI labels EQUALS [0, 0, 1, 1]
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL nearest (points, labels, [2, 2])
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL nearest (points, labels, [5, 6])

BACK TO THE MATRIX
